case and confirmed or corrected the diagnoses  GROSS DESCRIPTION  Received are 2 containers  which are all  labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME   REMOVE_MRN  Received fresh and labeled  right breast   is a 23 x 15 x 3 5cm mastectomy specimen with a suture designating axillary tail  The specimen bears a REMOVED_DATE x 6 5cm skin ellipse with a central 3 x 3 5cm nipple areolar complex  The lateral aspect of the skin ellipse bears a well healed 3 5cm linear defect and immediately subjacent is a REMOVED_DATE x 0 1cm ovoid non healed defect  Deep to the incision site is a poorly defined firm nodularity approximating 5 x 3 x 2cm  The anterior aspect of the specimen is inked blue  the posterior aspect of the specimen is inked black  Located in the superolateral aspect of the specimen is a 3 x 2cm heterogenous firm yellow tan region which extends to the overlying black inked margin  Deep to the well healed incision is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 5cm cavity consistent with prior surgical site  This lesion is centrally hemorrhagic and peripherally firm and yellow tan with focal peripheral yellow orange punctate irregularities  This cavity extends to 0 1cm from the black inked margin and 2 3cm from the blue inked margin  The remaining parenchyma is focally fibrotic but otherwise grossly unremarkable  Sections are submitted as follows   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Cavitary lesion to black inked margin   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Representative sections of cavitary lesion   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Cavitary lesion with peripheral orange yellow nodularities   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Representative sections of cavitary lesion   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Fibrous bands extending anteriorly from cavitary lesion   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Representative sections of fibrous firm region in superolateral aspect of specimen   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Representative sections distant from lesion  Received fresh and labeled  left breast   is a 22 x REMOVED_DATE x 3cm mastectomy specimen bearing a REMOVED_DATE x